# 18. Forward DNS Lookup

Forward lookup asks:

> **What IP address belongs to this hostname?**

Example:

```text
www.example.com
       ↓
DNS
       ↓
203.0.113.10
```

---

# 19. Reverse DNS Lookup

Reverse lookup asks:

> **What hostname is associated with this IP address?**

Example:

```text
203.0.113.10
       ↓
DNS
       ↓
server.example.com
```

PTR records are commonly involved.

