# 39. Virtual Host vs Subdomain

These concepts are related but not identical.

### Subdomain

A DNS name such as:

```text
api.example.com
```

### Virtual Host

A web server configuration that allows multiple websites/hostnames to be served by the same server or IP.

Therefore:

> **A subdomain is a DNS concept; a virtual host is commonly a web-server hosting concept.**

