# 41. Zone Transfer Scenario

### Scenario

A company has:

```text
Primary DNS
     ↓
Secondary DNS
```

The administrator intends only the secondary DNS server to receive zone transfers.

However, the DNS server is configured to allow transfers from unauthorized clients.

An authorized security tester identifies this configuration problem.

### Result

The tester may be able to obtain zone information containing many DNS records.

### Finding

> **Improperly restricted DNS zone transfer**

